# The build context is the repository root (docker build -f htmgo-site/Dockerfile .).
# Exclude everything, then allow only the directories this image needs.
*
!cli/htmgo
!framework
!tools/html-to-htmgo
!htmgo-site

# Project exclude paths
**/tmp
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__htmgo
**/.idea
**/go.work
**/go.work.sum
!framework/assets/dist
